      <li><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/hosted_control_planes/hcp-prepare/hcp-enable-disable#hcp-enable-manual_hcp-enable-disable">Manually enabling the hosted control planes feature</a></li>
      <li><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/hosted_control_planes/hcp-prepare/hcp-enable-disable#hcp-disable-feature_hcp-enable-disable">Disabling the hosted control planes feature</a></li>
